@page "/activities"
<PageTitle>Taniti : Activities</PageTitle>

<div class="card mb-4">
    <div class="row g-0">
        
        <div class="col-md-8">
            <div class="card-header custom-header">
                Outdoor Activities
            </div>
            <div class="card-body">
                <p class="card-text">
                    Taniti offers a wide range of outdoor experiences, from relaxing on sandy beaches to exploring lush rainforest trails. Visitors can enjoy natural scenery, wildlife, and the island’s active volcano.
                </p>

                <ul class="list-group list-group-flush">
                    <li class="list-group-item">Beaches</li>
                    <li class="list-group-item">Rainforest exploration</li>
                    <li class="list-group-item">Visits to the active volcano</li>
                    <li class="list-group-item">Snorkeling</li>
                    <li class="list-group-item">Zip-lining in the rainforest</li>
                    <li class="list-group-item">Hikes in the rainforest</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="col-md-4">
            <img src="images/rainforest.jpg"
                 alt="Outdoor Activities Image"
                 class="img-fluid rounded-end activities-image mx-auto d-block" />
        </div>

    </div>
</div>

<div class="card mb-4">
    <div class="row g-0">
        
        <div class="col-md-8">
            <div class="card-header custom-header">
                Entertainment & Leisure
            </div>
            <div class="card-body">
                <p class="card-text">
                    From cultural attractions to nightlife and family-friendly fun, Taniti provides a variety of entertainment options for visitors of all ages.
                </p>

                <ul class="list-group list-group-flush">
                    <li class="list-group-item">Local history museum</li>
                    <li class="list-group-item">Chartered fishing tours</li>
                    <li class="list-group-item">Several pubs, including a microbrewery</li>
                    <li class="list-group-item">Dance club</li>
                    <li class="list-group-item">Movie theater</li>
                    <li class="list-group-item">Helicopter rides</li>
                    <li class="list-group-item">Arcade</li>
                    <li class="list-group-item">Art galleries</li>
                    <li class="list-group-item">Bowling</li>
                    <li class="list-group-item">Nine-hole golf course (opening next year)</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="col-md-4">
            <img src="images/fishing02.jpg"
                 alt="Entertainment Image"
                 class="img-fluid rounded-end activities-image mx-auto d-block" />
        </div>

    </div>
</div>

<div class="card mb-4">
    <div class="row g-0">

        <div class="col-md-8">
            <div class="card-header custom-header">
                Sightseeing & Tours
            </div>
            <div class="card-body">
                <p class="card-text">
                    Taniti offers scenic views, cultural landmarks, and guided tours that help visitors experience the island’s beauty and history.
                </p>

                <ul class="list-group list-group-flush">
                    <li class="list-group-item">Taniti City’s native architecture</li>
                    <li class="list-group-item">White sandy beaches around Yellow Leaf Bay</li>
                    <li class="list-group-item">Boat tours of the island</li>
                    <li class="list-group-item">Bus tours of the island</li>
                    <li class="list-group-item">Visits to the active volcano</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="col-md-4">
            <img src="images/beaches.jpg"
                 alt="Sightseeing Image"
                 class="img-fluid rounded-end activities-image mx-auto d-block" />
        </div>

    </div>
</div>